    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-28.t01",
      "en": "I wanted a cheaper tent, so I bought a smaller one.",
      "es": "Quería una tienda más barata, así que compré una más pequeña.",
      "explanationEs": "One sustituye al nombre contable tent: a smaller tent.",
      "segments": [
        "I wanted a cheaper tent, so",
        "I bought a smaller one."
      ],
      "audioText": "I wanted a cheaper tent, so I bought a smaller one.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-cohesion-reference-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-28.t02",
      "en": "Some campsites are noisy; the ones near the river are quiet.",
      "es": "Algunos campings son ruidosos; los que están cerca del río son tranquilos.",
      "explanationEs": "Ones sustituye a campsites en plural.",
      "segments": [
        "Some campsites are noisy; the ones",
        "near the river are quiet."
      ],
      "audioText": "Some campsites are noisy; the ones near the river are quiet.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-cohesion-reference-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-28.t03",
      "en": "Will it rain tomorrow? I hope not, but the forecast says so.",
      "es": "¿Lloverá mañana? Espero que no, pero el pronóstico dice que sí.",
      "explanationEs": "So y not sustituyen toda una cláusula: it will rain / it won't rain.",
      "segments": [
        "Will it rain tomorrow? I hope",
        "not, but the forecast says so."
      ],
      "audioText": "Will it rain tomorrow? I hope not, but the forecast says so.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n7-cohesion-reference-3"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n7.class-28.t04",
      "en": "They asked me to rent a bike, and I did so without checking the price.",
      "es": "Me pidieron alquilar una bici y lo hice sin comprobar el precio.",
      "explanationEs": "Did so sustituye a un verbo con su objeto: rented a bike.",
      "segments": [
        "They asked me to rent a bike, and",
        "I did so without checking the price."
      ],
      "audioText": "They asked me to rent a bike, and I did so without checking the price.",
